        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Thinning Filtering</choice_text>
          <commentary>순서가 바뀌었다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Filtering Expanding</choice_text>
          <commentary>Expanding은 선을 두껍게 하는 과정이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Expanding Thinning</choice_text>
